Source: jmdict-eng-common 3.6.2+20261019180022 from jmdict-simplified
(https://github.com/scriptin/jmdict-simplified). scripts/build_data.ts keeps each entry's
headwords, parts of speech and English glosses and splits entries by headword first character.
